  "description": "The GLEN is a bike for a wide range of use and every purpose. With 150 - 160 mm travel at the front and 150 mm at the rear, it is perfect for demanding trails. Based on our proven kinematics, the frame has been completely redeveloped. With almost the same weight, we were able to further improve the strength. The cross-sections of the tubes and wall thicknesses as well as all milled parts have been optimized and the leverage ratio further refined. The new GLEN pushes straight forward and is plusher on the trail without losing the excellent mid-travel-support.",
